{"id":"636458","name":"猪肉丝瓜汤粉","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/636458/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干米粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"丝瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好干米粉，起锅烧水，水开后，下入米粉，煮熟，盖上锅盖，焖20分钟。","img":"images/636458/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"过凉水，清洗干净(多洗几遍)。","img":"images/636458/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪肉和丝瓜都切成小条。","img":"images/636458/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅烧油，小火，鸡蛋煎成荷包蛋蛋。","img":"images/636458/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"铲至一边，下入丝瓜条翻炒断生。","img":"images/636458/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入稍宽的人，大火烧开。","img":"images/636458/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"猪肉加少许淀粉抓匀。","img":"images/636458/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"猪肉下入锅中，稍煮一会儿。","img":"images/636458/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下入米粉。","img":"images/636458/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再次煮开，加盐、鸡精、生抽调味。","img":"images/636458/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/636458/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/636458/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/636458/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}